Announcing xldlas v0.60
=======================

    I have recently placed version 0.60 of xldlas in sunsite's
    incoming directory:

        ftp://sunsite.unc.edu/pub/Linux/Incoming/xldlas-0.60-srcbin.tgz

    I expect it to be moved to:

