Subject: fetchmail 2.1 - a full-featured POP2/POP3/APOP/IMAP client
Date: 1996/11/30
Message-ID: <cola-quinlan-849317995-5641-0@proton.pathname.com>#1/1
X-Deja-AN: 201487724
