PowerRPC -- the most powerful RPC tool that has been developed,
            now has its version 1.1 released.

PowerRPC "RPCizes" generic multi-argument C functions and makes them
callable across process boundaries over TCP/IP networks.
Designed to bring the power of RPC programming to the "masses",
powerRPC is extremely easy to learn and use. With powerRPC,
you forget the low level socket, TLI, RPC stuff, the code will be
generated for you. So you can focus on writing the real application 
code. Also, You can easily move your existing application to a
distributed architecture.

PowerRPC makes everyone a guru in multiplatform RPC programming.

Free demo are available for SunOS4, SunOS5, Linux, SGI and HP-UX.
at http://www.netbula.com/products/powerrpc/

