System III and System 7 with only a 40MB disk.  John then graduated to 
Microport System V on an Intel 80286.  At last count, John has been 
responsible for machines representing 14 different versions of UNIX on 
12 different architectures.

John is currently retired and enjoying traveling overseas with his wife.

