I've just released Clobberd 2.4. For those who haven't used Clobberd 1.1,
Clobberd allows ISP's or any Linux/Unix operator to regulate their users.

You can set it up so that to will kick off your users after a X amount of
time online is used. This can be daily or in total. It will monitor their
